  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingPromissoryNotesDueOnBalanceSheetDateTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left; text-indent: -24px"&gt;※２．連結会計年度末日満期手形&lt;/p&gt;
